        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Ɛ-pa-rim a Cu-tha-lɛ̈k kɛnɛ Ba-rɛd kɛ Tɛ̈-ɣɛ̈th kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-daa kɛ Tɛ̈-ɣɛ̈th. ",
