          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Dha-bad kɛnɛ Cu-tha-lɛ̈k, kɛ E-dhɛr kɛnɛ Ɛl-ad tëë ca näk mëë ɛ kɛn i̱ wa ɣɔ̱k ji̱ Gɛ̈th pɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gua̱ndiɛn ni Ɛ-pa-rim kɛ par kɛ ni̱n ti ŋuan, kä cu ji̱ maarädɛ jɛ ben com. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-pa-rim tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ ciekdɛ, kä cuɛ ruët, cuɛ dap kɛ gat. Kä cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔli Bɛ-ri-ya, kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn i̱ ci jiääk ben dhɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
